Inspect the versions of one dataset.

Usage
  azd ai dataset versions [command]

Available Commands
  list : List the versions of a dataset.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for versions
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  List all registered versions of a dataset
    azd ai dataset versions list my-tests

Use azd ai dataset versions [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
